# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# Nothing here is required to deploy. Add only what you use:

# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL       Dedicated RPC (recommended in prod)
# PINATA_JWT                Server-only; enables /api/pin/* IPFS uploads
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FEE_WALLET    Platform fee recipient (omit = no fee ix)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL      Canonical + Open Graph base URL
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_NETWORK mainnet-beta | devnet | testnet
